{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROUGELIKE WITH META PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you frustrated by playing roguelike games where you die often and all you progress is lost? In THERE IS mORE every run counts. Each ore you mine will help you in the next cycle to get stronger and survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE CORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown underground and collect ores at daytime, but be back at the surface to protect THE CORE when the monster arrive at nighttime. A procedurally generated tile map guarantees that each adventure is filled with unique enemies, treasures, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15+ unique spells await discovery, each unlocked through the runes you find throughout the game. Collect 4 runes to gain a powerful new spell. Use them wisely - some offer protection, others unleash devastating damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.poster.avif?t=1760083754\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.webm?t=1760083754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.mp4?t=1760083754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEAR THE DEPTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets. Keep your lamp burning at all times - without its light, your sanity will fade, and madness will take over. Stay in the dark for too long and the NIGHTMARE WORM will rise from the depths to hunt you down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AND DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the nights, you will unlock more and more content, which provides new opportunities to prepare and fight back against the enemies. And be sure: You will receive an awesome reward for surviving night 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GREAT ON THE GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with handheld gaming in mind, the game is optimized for Steam Deck from the start of development. Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience on the device is a top priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931000?t=1760083754","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/2c3c439352a3badbe21c6305b35e5e01a4e34d74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760083754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/195d42b76ad34d956c471ae18db3da153c59a1c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760083754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/195d42b76ad34d956c471ae18db3da153c59a1c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760083754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROUGELIKE WITH META PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you frustrated by playing roguelike games where you die often and all you progress is lost? In THERE IS mORE every run counts. Each ore you mine will help you in the next cycle to get stronger and survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROTECT THE CORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown underground and collect ores at daytime, but be back at the surface to protect THE CORE when the monster arrive at nighttime. A procedurally generated tile map guarantees that each adventure is filled with unique enemies, treasures, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15+ unique spells await discovery, each unlocked through the runes you find throughout the game. Collect 4 runes to gain a powerful new spell. Use them wisely - some offer protection, others unleash devastating damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.poster.avif?t=1760083754\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.webm?t=1760083754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/extras/f9817c2954ce4c162d2f9d5a75f781bf.mp4?t=1760083754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEAR THE DEPTHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets. Keep your lamp burning at all times - without its light, your sanity will fade, and madness will take over. Stay in the dark for too long and the NIGHTMARE WORM will rise from the depths to hunt you down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK AND DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the nights, you will unlock more and more content, which provides new opportunities to prepare and fight back against the enemies. And be sure: You will receive an awesome reward for surviving night 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GREAT ON THE GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with handheld gaming in mind, the game is optimized for Steam Deck from the start of development. Ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience on the device is a top priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByteBeyond"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931000/137ac94f68220555a678812d723c0d9595b59335/header.jpg?t=1760083754","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2025 ByteBeyond. Developed by ByteBeyond. Published by ByteBeyond. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS or Ubuntu 20.04+  <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM / DirectX 11+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS or Ubuntu 20.04+  <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM / DirectX 11+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3931000/85333474/d2a4204bef7252680c1e18d19df81aab5c75c7fe/1755672248/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755673089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.s